				Time="2011-06-13T07:05:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>で　おまはん
プラズマ団は　悪いと　思うか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T04:54:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T07:05:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・主人公と向き合ってメッセージ表示
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
・はい　→swleader8_06
　いいえ→swleader8_07</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-16T07:43:54" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
