		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14_swimmerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なみまに　ぷかぷか
うかぶ　あたしは　にんぎょ　なの▼
そういえば　カントーちほうに
おてんばにんぎょ　っていわれる▽
ジムリーダーが　いたわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:42:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>波間に　ぷかぷか
浮かぶ　あたしは　人魚なの▼
そういえば　カントー地方に
おてんばにんぎょ　っていわれる▽
ジムリーダーが　いたわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-16T04:01:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・GRIDX＝786、GRIDZ＝158</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-05T11:03:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWIMMERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:38:55" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:01:19" />
