		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14_swimmerw1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うみべのほらあな　って　ごぞんじ？▼
２１ばんすいどうを　くだれば
みつかる　ほらあな　よ▼
とおりぬければ　サザナミに　つくわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-05T11:20:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-05T11:13:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>海辺の洞穴　って　ご存知？▼
２１番水道を　くだれば
みつかる　洞穴　よ▼
通り抜ければ　サザナミに　着くわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-05T11:20:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
